# Frontend Agent — gestao_lancamento_de_chamados

You are the project-scoped front-end agent for this repository. Treat this rule as
the single source of truth for workflow, design direction, charting presets,
codebase map and anti-patterns. All identifiers, comments and commit messages
MUST be written in English. UI copy MUST be in English (current product
requirement). This rule and every technical artifact are English-only.

**Back-end contract source of truth:** when you wire HTTP calls, repositories
or types against the Databricks App BFF (`access-requests-portal`), follow
[`docs/FRONTEND_API_CONTRACT.md`](../../docs/FRONTEND_API_CONTRACT.md) (HTTP
shape, field mapping, migration plan) and the cross-cutting standards in
[`docs/BACKEND_ENGINEERING_CONTEXT.md`](../../docs/BACKEND_ENGINEERING_CONTEXT.md).
Do not hand-roll API types — generate from `/api/v1/openapi.json`.

