## 2. Codebase map (single source of truth)

### Stack
- Build: Vite + React 19 + TypeScript.
- Styling: Tailwind 4 (single utility-first system, no CSS-in-JS).
- Icons: `lucide-react`. Animations: `motion`. Charts: `recharts`.

### Persistence
- No backend, no database. State lives in `localStorage` under the key
  `ab_inbev_tickets_db_v8`, hydrated and persisted by [src/App.tsx](src/App.tsx).
- Never persist credentials, tokens or PII in `localStorage`.

### Entry points
- [index.html](index.html)
- [src/main.tsx](src/main.tsx)
- [src/App.tsx](src/App.tsx)

### Components (one-line purpose each)
- [src/components/TicketForm.tsx](src/components/TicketForm.tsx) (~646 lines) —
  Form 1.0, ticket create/edit plus bulk "Acesso Full".
- [src/components/TicketForm2.tsx](src/components/TicketForm2.tsx) (~786 lines) —
  Jira Service Desk clone (Form 2.0). Roughly 80% duplicated from `TicketForm`.
- [src/components/SheetDatabase.tsx](src/components/SheetDatabase.tsx) (~2.4k
  lines) — monolith holding filters, CSV/TSV import/export, simulated SharePoint
  Graph + Jira sync and mass actions. Highest refactor priority.
- [src/components/Dashboard.tsx](src/components/Dashboard.tsx) — KPIs and
  Recharts. Current KPI formulas are heuristic and not auditable.
- [src/components/ToastNotification.tsx](src/components/ToastNotification.tsx) —
  global toast stack powered by `motion`.

### Domain types
- [src/types.ts](src/types.ts) — `Ticket`, `TicketStatus`, `TicketPriority`,
  `REQUIRE_SYSTEMS`, `ROLES`, `EQUIPES`, `EMAIL_DOMAINS`.

### Dead dependencies (no usage under `src/`, slated for removal)
- `firebase`, `express`, `dotenv`, `@google/genai`, `@types/express`.

### Missing infrastructure (known gaps)
- No automated tests, no ESLint or Prettier config, no `.github/` workflows, no
  husky hooks.
- `npm run lint` is currently only `tsc --noEmit`.
- `npm run clean` references a nonexistent `server.js` and must be fixed or
  removed.

