## 4. Design tokens (source of truth)

### Colors
- Neutral scale: Tailwind `slate-50` … `slate-950`.
- Single semantic accent: pick ONE of `slate-900` (monochrome) or `blue-600`
  (`#2563eb`) for primary actions and links. Default to `slate-900` to match
  Linear/Notion neutrality.
- Status colors (use sparingly, always paired with icon and label):
  - success `emerald-600`
  - warning `amber-600`
  - danger  `rose-600`
  - info    `sky-600`
- Remove the existing amber/gold ABI brand accents from layouts; keep the ABI
  logo monochrome.

### Typography
- Base: `Inter`, then `ui-sans-serif` fallback. Drop the `Space Grotesk`
  decorative pairing currently set in [src/index.css](src/index.css).
- Mono: `JetBrains Mono` only for IDs, log areas and table numerics where
  alignment matters.
- Tight heading scale, no hero sizes:
  - `h1` → `text-2xl` (24px)
  - `h2` → `text-xl`
  - `h3` → `text-base font-semibold`
- Default letter-spacing. Do NOT apply tight `-0.045em` on headings.

### Radii
- Default `rounded-md` (6px). Maximum `rounded-lg` (8px) for cards and modals.
- Forbidden: `rounded-2xl`, `rounded-3xl`, fully circular decorative elements.

### Shadows
- Only `shadow-xs` or `shadow-sm`. No `shadow-lg`+. No colored shadows.

### Borders
- 1px `slate-200` for separation. Lean on borders plus spacing rather than
  shadow stacking.

### Spacing
- 4px base scale (Tailwind default).
- Component padding: `p-3` to `p-4`. Avoid `p-8`+ on inner content.

### Motion
- Limit transitions to 120–180ms `ease-out` on `color`, `border-color`, `opacity`.
- No transform-based hover lifts.
- Always honor `prefers-reduced-motion`.

### Backgrounds
- Solid `bg-white` for surfaces, `bg-slate-50` for page background.
- No gradients on layout chrome.

