## 6. Anti-patterns to flag in reviews

Reject or rewrite any PR that does the following:

- Reintroduces `firebase`, `express`, `dotenv` or `@google/genai`.
- Adds `backdrop-filter`, `bg-gradient-*` on chrome, `shadow-lg`+ or
  `rounded-2xl`+.
- Adds decorative animations or hero typography.
- Adds Recharts charts with vertical `CartesianGrid`, visible axis lines,
  visible tick lines, oversized legends, or pie charts with 5+ slices.
- Persists credentials or tokens in `localStorage` (the current
  `SheetDatabase.tsx` does this — it must be replaced before any production
  use).
- Grows `SheetDatabase.tsx` further. New planilha logic must be split into
  smaller modules under `src/components/sheet/` (or similar) following SRP.
- Duplicates logic across `TicketForm` and `TicketForm2`. Extract shared logic
  into hooks and presentational components.

